---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="肝臟 Couinaud 8分段 3D 互動解剖系統 | 互動解剖圖鑑 - 黃冠智醫師" 
  description="Couinaud 肝臟 8 分段高擬真 3D 實體解剖系統。包含 360 度空間旋轉、3 條縱向肝靜脈、橫向門靜脈樹與超音波掃描切面指引。"
>
  <div class="liver-anatomy-page-wrapper">
    <!-- Sub-header bar with breadcrumbs -->
    <div class="anatomy-top-bar">
      <a href="/anatomy" class="back-link">
        <svg width="16" height="16" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 12H5M12 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
        <span>返回「互動解剖圖鑑」總覽</span>
      </a>
      <div class="current-organ-tag">
        <span class="pulse-dot"></span>
        <span>肝臟 (Liver) · Couinaud 3D 實體模型</span>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Embedded High-Performance 3D Anatomy App Iframe -->
    <div class="app-iframe-container">
      <iframe 
        src="/liver-anatomy.html" 
        title="Couinaud 肝臟 8 分段高擬真 3D 實體解剖系統"
        class="anatomy-iframe"
        allow="accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture"
      ></iframe>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .liver-anatomy-page-wrapper {
    width: 100%;
    min-height: calc(100vh - 72px);
    background: #070d18;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  .anatomy-top-bar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 0.65rem 1.5rem;
    background: rgba(13, 22, 41, 0.95);
    border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(56, 189, 248, 0.2);
  }

  .back-link {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    color: #38bdf8;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    transition: all 0.2s;
  }

  .back-link:hover {
    color: #7dd3fc;
    transform: translateX(-2px);
  }

  .current-organ-tag {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.45rem;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    color: #e2e8f0;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .pulse-dot {
    width: 8px;
    height: 8px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: #10b981;
    box-shadow: 0 0 8px #10b981;
  }

  .app-iframe-container {
    flex: 1;
    width: 100%;
    height: calc(100vh - 120px);
    position: relative;
  }

  .anatomy-iframe {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    border: none;
    display: block;
  }
</style>
